                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The provided data supports two aims: (1) to develop an expert model of AI risk perception in health using a mental-models approach in the context of risk research, and (2) to validate a new methodological workflow that leverages the large language model (LLM) of ChatGPT to support the development of an expert model. \n\nThe data is provided to ensure replicability of the procedure described in a submitted article to the Journal of Risk Research (Routledge)"
